    }

    If instead you want to only run the policy on any objects whose
    namespace is associated with the "environment" of "prod" or "staging";
    you will set the selector as follows:
    "namespaceSelector": {
      "matchExpressions": [
        {
          "key": "environment",
          "operator": "In",
          "values": [
            "prod",
            "staging"
          ]
        }
